s=3D"mord mathnormal">n</span></span></span></span> is the length of the ar=
ray. We could also sort the array and then perform the two-pointer algorith=
m used in <em>Pair Sum - Sorted</em>, which would take <span class=3D"katex=
"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/M=
athML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=3D"false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><m=
